OL,3,GNEWSAScooter champ 'battles' to win
OL,4,Athird world title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scooter champion who has won a world
OL,7,Ftitle for the third year running said
OL,8,Fhis latest triumph came after an
OL,9,F"absolute battle".
OL,11,FJayden Sharman, 22, started riding when
OL,12,Fhe was six and moved to Corby in 2020
OL,13,Fso he could train at Adrenaline Alley
OL,14,Fin the Northamptonshire town.
OL,16,FSharman, who recently suffered an ankle
OL,17,Finjury, fell in the first round but
OL,18,Fthen landed a "near-perfect" run in
OL,19,FSunday's final round at the Scootering
OL,20,FWorld Championships in Paraguay, said
OL,21,Fthe team at Adrenaline Alley.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
