OL,3,GNEWSAScooter champ 'battles' to win
OL,4,Athird world title
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharman said he would "never be able to
OL,7,Fput into words" his success at
OL,8,Fcompleting the hat-trick, which
OL,9,Ffollowed similar successes in 2024 and
OL,10,F2025.
